            - And since he heared by a student that $sister.name is successfully doing tutoring, he thought to take advantage of this and suggest a plan with the player.
        	- The player suggest using a modified version of a prototype to influence the whole class at once so the grades will improve fast. But this needs time and money. 
            - The Prof then offers it as a "research project". But until this is finished, the prof wants the sister to do more tutoring, even at school as well, especially for some troublesome students. This will play into the "internship" of the sister as well.
            - The prof wants the sister to act as the of face of the project at the college, since she's decently popular with the students and by that they may get more students to take the tutoring. 
